  "release_notes": "Hotfix on top of 1.0.62: today's Ready-log entries that were persisted under the pre-1.0.62 layout (timestamp at the front: '[02:30 PM] Room 1: Ready') now get rewritten to the new layout (timestamp at the end: 'Room 1: Ready  [02:30 PM]') as they are replayed from the persisted file on launch, so the user sees the new layout consistently after upgrade instead of having to wait for the midnight rollover to wipe the file. The on-disk file is intentionally not rewritten — the migration runs on every launch until midnight, which is cheap and avoids any rewrite-during-load edge cases. Lines persisted in the new layout pass through the migration helper unchanged.",
